# Power BI Desktop writes these into a .pbip when it opens one. They are per-machine
# and per-user, never part of the project definition:
#   .pbi/localSettings.json   machine-bound security-binding signature
#   .pbi/cache.abf            a local cache of the loaded model data
#   .pbi/editorSettings.json  editor state
#   diagramLayout.json        where the tables sit in the model diagram
powerbi/**/.pbi/
powerbi/**/diagramLayout.json
